  "prompt": "The function\n[Figure 1]\nis defined by\n[Figure 2]\n. The graph of\n[Figure 3]\nin the\n[Figure 4]\n-plane is a parabola. Which of the following intervals contains the\n[Figure 5]\n-coordinate of the vertex of the graph of\n[Figure 6]\n?",
